    "description": "Hello my dear Folklore Friends! My goodness, what a month. Stacia and I were pooped at the end of October. Every year we say we are going to say no to everything, and every year we say yes to everything and end up getting burnt out. It’s worth it though. Thank you so much to everyone who came to see us when we were out and about. One of my highlights was an out of hours visit to the Tolhouse Museum in Great Yarmouth where we saw The Feathered Thorns performing WITCH. The is still a chance to catch their performance this month. All the details are",
